Package: cudagraphR
Title: GPU-Aware Graph Workflows for R
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides sparse graph construction and community-detection
    workflows for GPU-aware numerical results in R. Converts nearest-neighbour
    results into compact graph objects and supplies Louvain and Leiden
    clustering through an optional igraph backend.
